# divergences.pioneer_plan (settings.json). Hardy Pioneer 51 (100 tools) selected on unroaded plains (18,63), unclaimed by a tribe at peace.
key n     # VIEW Plan Pioneer on: View Pieces, cursor on the Pioneer's tile
key r     # plan a road on (18,63)
shot
key n     # Plan Pioneer off (still View Pieces)
key a     # Activate the Pioneer under the cursor
key q     # ORDERS Automate: road job on its own tile; plains threshold 3 >> 1 (Hardy) = 1, so the road is done at once (80 tools, order 0, plan bit gone, still automated)
wait 20
shot
